<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi É Teʋeni Tesalonike Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonike Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Keelai Pɔle é Tesalonike nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi velesiɛi ɠɛai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). É Tesalonike nuiti ta-zɛʋɛ mɔungi ɠɛɛni, su la ɠoozani é felesiɛi nii ɠɛ, kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu ɠila (51) kɛɠala leʋegai ma, Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Pɔle ɠɛni dɛ Kolɛnte siɛgi zu é niima zɛʋɛi ɠɛa la, é teʋe Tesalonike Egilisii ma, Egilisii nii é daaɠulani ná-keela ziɛi velesiɛi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-10">KKw 17:1-10</ref></char>). Bogɛ Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi zu ga Egilisii naa zu nuiti ti ɠɛni ga Zuifui tanigaani ta Gɛlɛkii ma mɔinmɔin.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ Tesalonike Egilisii wola ɠilini yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagiti ta-vai ʋa ta Kilista ʋaa laa velesiɛi, tɔɔzei Pɔle faa mɔinmɔin sɛʋɛʋɛ é lo naama vai ʋa ná-sɛʋɛiti su ti leʋegai Tesalonike nuiti ma. Tesalonike nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi velesiɛi ɠilazuʋɛ kpein ka ɓɔɛzu é lo yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagi ʋa. Pɔle ti wola lɛnɛni é lo faaʋaalalai ʋa. Nui ɠilagilagi pɛ maanɛɛʋɛ é botii ɠɛ kɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ fai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-10">3:6-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pɔle tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ, naa ʋoluma é siɛɲɔɠɔiti ɓalaa dɛɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. É zɛba é GALA mama ta é GALA fali Tesalonike Egilisii ʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Gaaɠwɛsu felegɔi zu, Pɔle ɠa ɓɔɛzu miná é lo yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagiti ba (<char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref>).</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kpɔɛʋɛ naa ʋolu, é lo faaʋaalalai ʋa, ta ʋelei fizɔgai la nu botii ɠɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Pɔle gaaɓelagɛ ga é ná-tuʋɔ gooi laazeeli Egilisii ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, gá Silase, naa ʋɛɛ Timɔte ʋa, gá wo luʋɔsu, wɔi wo Egilisii zu Tesalonike taazuʋɛ, wo ga Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA ta Maliɠii Yesu Kilista nɔnɔiti. <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA ta Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ti zaalai la wo ma, ti ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai Kilista ʋa voloi ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gi maanɛɛʋɛ gi mamagi ve GALA bɛ yeenɔpɛ wa-vaa zu, gaamazu naa zɔlegɛ, mazɔlɔɔ wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠa liizu luɠɔma gola, nɛɛbɛi é wo yɔɠɔzu, naa ɠa liizu ga wɔɔlɔa. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Gá unbuzeɠei lɛɛzu wa-vaa zu GALA ná-Egilisiiti su, tɔɔzei ʋelei wo loni la kpaan, ta ʋelei wa-ɠidaaleʋei la wɔinzeɠemaiti ta kpɔlɔiti pɛ saama wo sɔlɔɔsu.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Kpɔlɔi nii ɠa é ga GALA ná-telebo tukpɔɠaaleʋei ma ʋoogi, naa ɠa é dɛɛzu ga wa zoloo GALA ná-masadai zɔlɔɔ fai ma, nii wo kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔsu maaʋele ma. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Soloogɛ ga GALA ge kpɔlɔi zei naati zea, niiti ti wo ɓɔlɔ vai laazu wo ya. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Wɔiti wo kpɔlɔi zu, GALA ge dooɠogi ve wo ya, ta gá ɓɔɠɔi gi ya, siɛgi zu Maliɠii Yesu ɠulazu la kɛlɛma, é zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ta ná-geezuɠeelaiti, zɛbɛ wolai ti ya. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Toɠa ʋa abuzogi zaama, ga é naati sala, niiti ti la GALA kwɛɛ, ti la ɠolozu Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ʋɛ, é ʋilɛ de-Maliɠii Yesu ʋa. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Ta ti-zalai zɔlɔɔ ga ɠɔoɠɔ undaaʋiligi, ti maaɠooza, ti zeɠe Maliɠii ɠaazu, ti maaɠooza ná-zobogi ma lɛbiyai ʋa, <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>siɛgi zu é ʋaazu la naama voloi, ga é lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ ná-nuiti zea, niiti ta ɠidaaleʋe ma. Wa ɠɛ naati saama niiti ta maawui, tɔɔzei wo ɠidaaleʋeni gá-zeele wooi ma, gi boni wo ma.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gá GALA falizu wo ʋɛ yeenɔpɛ, nii a kɛ ada-ƓALAGI wo ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, wo zoloo toligi ma, é bogai ga woye. Gá falizu ná-zɛbɛi zu, ga faa ʋagɔi nii pɛ wo wɔinɗai ga wo kɛ, é naa laazeeli wo ʋɛ ga pagɔ, é wa-ɠidaaleʋei ma ɠɛɛwotii ɠaavɔni, <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>naa ɠa a kɛ Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ wo maaʋele ma, wa ɓalaa wo lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ tɔun maaʋele ma, eɠɛʋelei da-ƓALAGI ná-zaalai la, ta de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔ Koloɠolo Nui ná-fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nii é ga ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ʋaa vai, ta ada-maaɓɔ fai tɔun koba, gá wo maanɛɛnɛzu, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>à mina va bu, wo yii ʋa ɓɔlɔ, wo zasu ʋa ɓali ga wooi ta, ga Maliɠii ná-foloi zeelia. Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ nui ta boni wo ma, kɛai ma kulakɛlɛma vaiti bosu, ɓaa é ɗa tɛnɛgi wo, ɓaa tanisu ti boni wo ma ga gi sɛʋɛni gá-zɛʋɛi ta zu. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>À mina va bu, nu nɔpɛ ge ʋa wo ɠaka pele nɔpɛ ma. Mazɔlɔɔ aisa naama voloi ʋa zeeli, kɛni pele ʋilɛgi ɠɛ mɔunpa, Tɔ Koloɠolo Nui ɠula kɛlɛma, zunui nii undaaʋiligi leveai ma. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Tɔ Koloɠolo Nui naa, nii é wuzeɠezu naati pɛ daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti lolisu ga galagiti, ɓaa nuɓusɛ a ti lɛbi, eyɛsu é li, é zei GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɓɔɠɔ lɛ eɠɛ a ɠɛ ga GALA.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Wo-ɠi ge la su ɓaa, ga gè niima vaiti boni wo ma, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni la dɛ wo ʋɔ bɛ? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, wo suɠwɛɛ, nii é pele ɓesasu dɛ tuɠɔ, ga é mina ɠula kɛlɛma kɛni ná-yeeɠɛɠalai. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Tɔ Koloɠolo Nui ná-zobogi é botii ɠɛɛzu la dɔɔɠuzu, naa ɠa ɠula niina kɛlɛma, kɛlɛ kɛni zɔi é pele ɓesasu dɛ tuɠɔ, naa a ɲɛɛlɛna. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Názu Tɔ Koloɠolo Nui ɠa ɠula niina kɛlɛma. Maliɠii Yesu ɠa paa ga laa viilɛi, é koloɠolo ga ná-kulakɛlɛmai ma zezei. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Tɔ Koloɠolo Nui naa ɠa ʋa ga Setana ná-zɛbɛi, é ɗa zɛɛ laavɔɔ vaiti kɛ, ta zɛɛ maaɓɛlɛ vaiti pɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Toɠa telebotalai ma zii pɛ kɛ ga é naati kaka, niiti ti undaaʋilisu. Ti undaa ɠa ʋili, tɔɔzei ti la yeezeini gaamai wu, ti ʋa nɛɛ ʋɛ, nii a la ti ɠizo. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ka kakagi ma zobo golai leʋe ti ma, nii a kɛ ti la zɛɛi la, <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, niiti kpein ti la ɠidaaleʋeni gaamai ma, kɛlɛ ti telebotalai nɛai ʋɛ, ti ʋeelala.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tesalonike nuiti ta-lo kpaangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wɔi wo nɛai Maliɠii ʋɛ, maanɛɛʋɛ yeenɔpɛ gɔun gi ɗa GALA mama wa-vaa zu. Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge yiimazeɠeʋɛ ga woye kaite tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa, é wo ɠizo Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zaalai zu nii é wo ɲadesu, ta wa-ɠidaaleʋei maaʋele gaamai ma. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>GALA ge wo loligɛ naa ma ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi maaʋele, gi daazeelini wo ma ga wo ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Deɠɛmu, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à lo kpaan, wo kala gooiti so, niiti gi ti woni wo ma ga gi-laaʋɛ, ɓaa ga zɛʋɛi.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Ade-Ɠɛɛ GALA nii é ade wola nɛai ʋɛ, é ɠɔoɠɔ iɲɔdɔɔi ve ade ʋɛ ta kito pagɔi ga zaalai maaʋele, ta ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ɓɔɠɔi <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>wo-yiiti daave ga iɲɔdɔɔi, é wo zɛbɛlɔ, wo ziɛ ga faa ʋagɔiti pɛ, kɛɛwotiiti su ta wo ɓɔɛ ʋeleiti su.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Toligi é lo GALA falii ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gaaɓelagi ɠa ga: À GALA fali gi ʋɛ, ga Maliɠii laawooi li ga vazaga, é lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛzu la wo ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>À GALA fali ɓalaa ga é gi ɠizo faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta suɲɔu nuiti ma, mazɔlɔɔ kidaaleʋei la ɛsɛ pɛ zea.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Kɛlɛ Maliɠii ɠa ga wooɠɛɠila nu. Toɠa wo zɛbɛlɔ, é wo makɛ ma ɲɔi ma. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Maliɠii naama ladalai veeʋɛ gi ya wa-vaa zu, ga fai niiti gi ɠɛai wo ti ɠɛ, wa naati kɛɛzu, ta wa yɛsu ti ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Maliɠii lo wo-yiimaʋɛti tuɠɔ, ti laazeeli GALA ná-nɛɛbɛi zu faan, ta é ziilɔɔi ma zobogi ve wo ʋɛ ga Kilista ɠɛʋele faan.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Botii ɠɛ ungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gá wo levezu, Maliɠii Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu, ga wo maaɠooza ɠɛɛɠɛloin kpein ba, niiti ti eteai ziɛzu dɔɔʋɛi zu, ti la ziɛzu ga kalagi naa, nii gi boni ga woye. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Wa ɓɔɠɔi wo suɠwɛɛ kpezekele, ʋelei wo maanɛai la wo ʋokɔɠɔ gi ma. Mazɔlɔɔ gi la ɠɛni zeini wo zaama ga dɔɔʋɛ vaa, <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>gi la ɠɛni vaani bu nu nɔpɛ ge ʋa gi ɠɔnɔkula ni gi la sɔngɔ veeni, kɛlɛ tɔun, gi kpɔlɔi ɠwɛɛni, ta gi botii ɠɛɛni folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa, nii a kɛ gi mina ɠɛ ga kasɔ wo taɠila kpalaa unma. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>É la ga ma zobo ka é la ɠɛni gi ʋɛ, kɛlɛ wɔin ɠɛni gi ma, ga gi poo fe wo ya, wa ɠɛ ziɛzu la. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu gi ɠɛni la wo ʋɔ bɛ, gi niima levei veeni wo ya ga: «Zɔi nɔpɛ é la pɔ ga é botii ɠɛ, é mina daami wo.»<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Tama gá mɛnisu ga, tanigaa ta wo zaama, ti ta-eteai ziɛzu dɔɔʋɛi zu, ti la faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu, kɛni faazupui nɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Gá ɓɔɛzu naama nui naati pɔ Maliɠii Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu, devei gi feezu, toɠa ga ti botii ɠɛ ziilɛigi zu, ti-zɔlɔɔ ganii ɠɛ ga ti-ɠɔnɔgi.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Wɔun wo letegi, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à mina ɓɔlɔ ga faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Ni nui ta la ɠɛ ziɛni ga kala gooi nii gi bosu wo ma niima zɛʋɛi zu, à ɠizɛ su, kpɔfaama nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu, wa tiyagaani, naa ɠa a kɛ ti unfe. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>À mina pɛtɛ ga wo zili nu, kɛlɛ à tɛnɛ eɠɛ ɠɛɛɠɛloun.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuya loo vai ta tuʋɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Maliɠii nii é ziilɛigi veezu, naa ɓɔɠɔi ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ mɛtu fai pɛ su. Maliɠii yɛ wo pɛ wo ʋa.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Nà Pɔle, nà ɓɔɠɔi zèeʋogi ɠa gè wo luʋɔsu da. Naa ɠa é ga zèeʋogi nà-sɛʋɛiti pɛ su, zekana nà ɗa sɛʋɛ la.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>De-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-zaalai yɛ wo pɛ wo ʋa.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
